{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12303750","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12303750","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1230375001:1":{"text":"港が開放されて、一攫千金のチャンスがきたと思ったのに、ブラッディ・マリーの奴らが管理を強化して、密ゆ――","source_cn":"港口开放了，眼看赚大把金币的时机到了，但血薇帮却收紧了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41940C81EE32A259","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230375002:1":{"text":"おっとっと、声が大きすぎた。まあ、とにかく、みんなが欲しがってるもんを転売する商売でさあ。","source_cn":"——嘘，小声点。你懂的，就是转卖点人们需要的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA70F7C822F3C2845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230375003:1":{"text":"まあ、買いたい人がいるかぎり、密輸はなくなりませんよ。へっ、今に見てろってんだ。","source_cn":"要我说，只要人们需求，走私这个口子就永远堵不上。走着瞧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3170668BF345CB48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:情报贩子灰舌":{"text":"情報屋のアッシュタン","source":"情报贩子灰舌","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}